    "type": "WSI",
    "diagnosis": "Malignant peripheral nerve sheath tumour",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "A poorly circumscribed, necrotic, atypical spindle cell proliferation with wavy nuclei. Cellular areas alternate with hypocellular myxoid zones, with mild pleomorphism. Slightly increased cellularity is seen adjacent to blood vessels.",
